{%- comment -%}
  Roman Skin Care — Terms of Service Section
  Self-contained legal page with inline styles.
  Last reviewed: April 2026
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- style -%}
  .roman-tos {
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 5rem 2rem 7rem;
    font-family: inherit;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .roman-tos__header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e4df;
    padding-bottom: 2.4rem;
  }

  .roman-tos__title {
    font-size: 3.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .roman-tos__date {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: #888;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .roman-tos__intro {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #444;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    padding: 2rem 2.4rem;
    background: #f7f4f1;
    border-left: 3px solid #c8a882;
    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
  }

  .roman-tos__section {
    margin-bottom: 3.6rem;
  }

  .roman-tos__section-title {
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ede9e4;
  }

  .roman-tos__section-number {
    color: #c8a882;
    margin-right: 0.4rem;
  }

  .roman-tos__body {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #444;
  }

  .roman-tos__body p {
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
  }

  .roman-tos__body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .roman-tos__body ul,
  .roman-tos__body ol {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 1.2rem 2rem;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .roman-tos__body li {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .roman-tos__body a {
    color: #c8a882;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .roman-tos__body a:hover {
    color: #a8845e;
  }

  .roman-tos__body strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1a1a1a;
  }

  .roman-tos__contact-box {
    margin-top: 4rem;
    padding: 2.4rem;
    background: #f7f4f1;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .roman-tos__contact-box p {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #444;
    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .roman-tos__contact-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 1.2rem 2.8rem;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }

  .roman-tos__contact-btn:hover {
    background: #333;
    color: #fff;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .roman-tos {
      padding: 3rem 1.6rem 5rem;
    }

    .roman-tos__title {
      font-size: 2.6rem;
    }

    .roman-tos__section-title {
      font-size: 1.7rem;
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<div class="roman-tos">

  <header class="roman-tos__header">
    <h1 class="roman-tos__title">Terms of Service</h1>
  </header>

  <p class="roman-tos__intro">
    Please read these Terms of Service carefully before using the Roman Skin website or placing an order. By accessing our website or making a purchase, you agree to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use our website.
  </p>

  <!-- 1. About Roman Skin -->
  <div class="roman-tos__section">
    <h2 class="roman-tos__section-title">
      <span class="roman-tos__section-number">1.</span> About Roman Skin
    </h2>
    <div class="roman-tos__body">
      <p>Roman Skin ("<strong>Roman Skin</strong>," "<strong>we</strong>," "<strong>us</strong>," or "<strong>our</strong>") operates this website and offers professional-grade skincare products for sale directly to consumers and authorized wholesale partners within the United States.</p>
      <p>Our website is intended for use by individuals who are at least 18 years of age, or the age of majority in their jurisdiction, whichever is greater. By using this site you confirm that you meet this requirement.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. Acceptance of Terms -->
  <div class="roman-tos__section">
    <h2 class="roman-tos__section-title">
      <span class="roman-tos__section-number">2.</span> Acceptance of Terms
    </h2>
    <div class="roman-tos__body">
      <p>By visiting our website, creating an account, or completing a purchase, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to these Terms of Service, our <a href="/policies/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>, and any other policies referenced herein. We reserve the right to update these terms at any time. Continued use of our website after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the revised terms.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 3. Products & Descriptions -->
  <div class="roman-tos__section">
    <h2 class="roman-tos__section-title">
      <span class="roman-tos__section-number">3.</span> Products &amp; Descriptions
    </h2>
    <div class="roman-tos__body">
      <p>We make every effort to display product colors, textures, and descriptions as accurately as possible. However, we cannot guarantee that your device's display accurately reflects the actual product. Product formulations, packaging, and availability are subject to change without notice.</p>
      <p>Our products are intended for external cosmetic use only. They are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease or medical condition. If you have a known skin allergy or sensitivity, review the full ingredient list before use. Discontinue use and consult a dermatologist or healthcare professional if irritation occurs.</p>
      <p>Roman Skin reserves the right to limit quantities, discontinue products, or correct pricing errors at any time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 4. Pricing & Payment -->
  <div class="roman-tos__section">
    <h2 class="roman-tos__section-title">
      <span class="roman-tos__section-number">4.</span> Pricing &amp; Payment
    </h2>
    <div class="roman-tos__body">
      <p>All prices are listed in United States Dollars (USD) and are subject to change without notice. You will be charged the price displayed at the time you complete your order.</p>
      <p>We accept major credit cards and other payment methods as displayed at checkout. By submitting payment information, you represent that you are authorized to use that payment method and that the billing information provided is accurate.</p>
      <p>In the event of a pricing error on our website, we reserve the right to cancel any order placed at the incorrect price and notify you prior to fulfillment. You will not be charged for a cancelled order.</p>
      <p>Applicable sales tax will be calculated and added to your order at checkout based on the shipping destination.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 5. Orders & Order Confirmation -->
  <div class="roman-tos__section">
    <h2 class="roman-tos__section-title">
      <span class="roman-tos__section-number">5.</span> Orders &amp; Order Confirmation
    </h2>
    <div class="roman-tos__body">
      <p>Receipt of an order confirmation email does not constitute our acceptance of your order. We reserve the right to cancel or refuse any order for any reason, including but not limited to product unavailability, errors in product or pricing information, or suspected fraudulent activity.</p>
      <p>If your order is cancelled after payment has been processed, a full refund will be issued to your original payment method.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 6. Shipping -->
  <div class="roman-tos__section">
    <h2 class="roman-tos__section-title">
      <span class="roman-tos__section-number">6.</span> Shipping
    </h2>
    <div class="roman-tos__body">
      <p>Roman Skin currently ships within the United States only. Orders are typically processed and shipped within 1–2 business days, excluding weekends and holidays.</p>
      <p>Estimated delivery times are provided as a courtesy and are not guaranteed. Roman Skin is not responsible for delays caused by the carrier, weather, or other circumstances outside our control.</p>
      <p>Risk of loss and title for products purchased from Roman Skin pass to you upon delivery to the carrier. If your package is lost or damaged in transit, please contact us and we will work with the carrier to resolve the issue.</p>
      <p>You are responsible for providing an accurate and complete shipping address. Roman Skin is not liable for orders delivered to an incorrect address provided by the customer.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 7. Returns & Refunds -->
  <div class="roman-tos__section">
    <h2 class="roman-tos__section-title">
      <span class="roman-tos__section-number">7.</span> Returns &amp; Refunds
    </h2>
    <div class="roman-tos__body">
      <p>We accept returns within <strong>30 days</strong> of the delivery date under the following conditions:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>The item must be <strong>unused, unopened</strong>, and in its original packaging.</li>
        <li>The item must be in the same condition as when you received it.</li>
        <li>Opened or used skincare products are not eligible for return for health and safety reasons.</li>
        <li>Gift cards and final sale or clearance items are non-returnable.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To initiate a return, please contact us via our <a href="/pages/contact">Contact page</a> with your order number and reason for return. We will provide detailed return instructions. Return shipping costs are the responsibility of the customer unless the return is due to our error.</p>
      <p>Once we receive and inspect your return, we will notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund. Approved refunds are processed within 5–10 business days and credited to your original payment method.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 8. Intellectual Property -->
  <div class="roman-tos__section">
    <h2 class="roman-tos__section-title">
      <span class="roman-tos__section-number">8.</span> Intellectual Property
    </h2>
